<title>HONG KONG: BZW sets warrants on HK-listed China-backed stocks.</title>
<headline>BZW sets warrants on HK-listed China-backed stocks.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>BZW Warrants Ltd said it launched on Monday 400 million American-style call warrants on a basket of red chips, or China-backed stocks listed in Hong Kong.</p>
<p>Each basket comprises of:</p>
<p>China Merchants Hai Hong Holdings Co Ltd  0.3  share</p>
<p> China Resources Enterprise Ltd		0.16 share</p>
<p> Beijing Enterprises Holdings Ltd	    0.1  share</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	 HK$13.873   PREMIUM	 19.58  PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	  HK$0.359    GEARING	 4.07x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	   27.FEB.98   MIN EXER LOT  10,000</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT     HK$14.603   PAYDATE	 24.JUN.97</p>
<p> LISTING		LUXEMBOURG  LISTING DATE  24.JUN.97</p>
<p> NOTE		   PHYSICAL OR CASH SETTLEMENT AT ISSUER'S</p>
<p>DISCRETION</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441.  http://www.hk97.com</p>
</text>
